            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Transparent"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A slithering rift is so clear that it's difficult to spot. A successful DC 48 Perception check is required to notice a stationary slithering rift, and a creature must be Searching to attempt this check. A creature that walks into the rift's space might fall into any pit currently in effect due to Dimensional Pit."
